The material says:
- A service address has the form "k9://HOST:PORT".
- It must start with the scheme "k9://" (lowercase).
- HOST is made of 2 to 4 labels.
- Each label is 1 to 8 characters long.
- Labels can only have lowercase letters and digits.
- A label may not start with a digit.
- PORT is required.

